---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../config";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description={`About ${SITE.title}`}>
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 2rem; padding-bottom: 3rem;">
    <h1>About {SITE.title}</h1>

    <p>
      Welcome to <strong>{SITE.title}</strong> — your go-to resource for
      practical, honest reviews and guides on everything related to remote work
      and the digital nomad lifestyle.
    </p>

    <h2>Why we started this</h2>
    <p>
      Working remotely changed our lives. But finding the right gear, tools, and
      productivity strategies took way too much trial and error. We built this
      site to cut through the noise and give you straight-up recommendations
      that actually work for real remote workers.
    </p>

    <h2>What we cover</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Home office setup:</strong> desks, chairs, monitors, lighting,
        cable management — everything you need to build a comfortable workspace
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Remote work tools:</strong> software, apps, and platforms that
        make working from home easier and more productive
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Productivity:</strong> time management, focus techniques,
        routines, and habits for remote workers
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Digital nomad gear:</strong> portable setups, travel tech,
        co-working essentials for working on the road
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we review products</h2>
    <p>
      We research thoroughly, compare objectively, and only recommend products
      we genuinely believe add value for remote workers. Every article includes
      honest pros and cons — we never recommend something just for a commission.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate disclosure</h2>
    <p>
      Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you buy something through
      them, we may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. This helps
      us keep the site running and create more useful content. We only recommend
      products we truly stand behind.
    </p>

    <p>
      Have a question or suggestion? Reach out — we'd love to hear from you.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>